# Firmware configuration headers

`secrets.example.h` is the configuration template for the ESP32 timing unit. Copy it to `secrets.h`, enter the Wi-Fi, MQTT, device, and backend values, and keep the copy out of source control:

```powershell
Copy-Item secrets.example.h secrets.h
```

`src/main.cpp` includes `secrets.h` when it exists and falls back to the template so that the project can still be inspected or compiled with placeholder values.

Use a unique `RIADHA_DEVICE_ID` and MQTT account for each physical unit. The device ID, MQTT username, ACL rules, and topic paths must agree. See the [hardware guide](../README.md) and [broker guide](../../backend/infra/mosquitto/README.md).
